W-07 review: Request changes. Fix the one Must fix item below, then re-report (same format, include checks).

Must fix:
1. `app/e2e/smoke.spec.ts:9-14` is flaky. `npx playwright test smoke --repeat-each=15` gives 14 failed and 1 passed, each with "Execution context was destroyed… navigation". The cause is that `/` now redirects on the client: the h1 check passes on the "Suuname…" heading, and then axe runs while the page is navigating away. That breaks the W-01 e2e AC. Fix: wait for the redirect before running axe, e.g.
   await page.goto('/');
   await page.waitForURL('**/ee/*/');
   await expect(page.getByRole('heading', { level: 1 })).toBeVisible();
   Pointing the smoke test at `/ee/et/` instead is also acceptable. To verify, run `cd app && npx playwright test smoke --repeat-each=15` (must be all green) and `npm run check`.

Fix only this. Don't commit.

